From f237fd351c0f01c9dc473f10dca5baa2a327796e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 15:29:00 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 228/245] reaper theme: scope device-glyph red recolor to View
 List (fix VPN Fusion + other client-icon pages)

reaper_content.css:524 recolored all i[class^=type]/vendor-icon device glyphs to theme red with an UNSCOPED !important rule, so the masked device icons rendered as solid red blocks on every page carrying them (notably the VPN Fusion client list, making its row controls unusable). Every sibling rule in the same block is already scoped to .clientlist_viewlist; scope this one to match its intended View-List target. Field report 2026-07-25 (RT-BE86U v1.7.7).
---
 release/src/router/www/reaper/reaper_content.css | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/release/src/router/www/reaper/reaper_content.css b/release/src/router/www/reaper/reaper_content.css
index fb6a17a30b..b1f92aaa9f 100644
--- a/release/src/router/www/reaper/reaper_content.css
+++ b/release/src/router/www/reaper/reaper_content.css
@@ -521,7 +521,7 @@ table.content{background-image:none!important;background-color:#08080a!important
    appended reaper block relocated here (those files revert to pristine). Client
    icon tiles are already dark via section 9; these are the selectors section 9/12
    did not cover: red device/vendor glyphs + the "View List" modal (.RT skin). ---------- */
-i[class^='type'],i[class*=' type'],i[class^='vendor-icon'],i[class*=' vendor-icon']{background-color:#E10600!important}
+.clientlist_viewlist i[class^='type'],.clientlist_viewlist i[class*=' type'],.clientlist_viewlist i[class^='vendor-icon'],.clientlist_viewlist i[class*=' vendor-icon']{background-color:#E10600!important}
 .clientlist_viewlist .client_icon>div{background-color:#000!important;border-color:#330000!important;box-shadow:none!important}
 .clientlist_viewlist .card,.clientlist_viewlist .card.client_list .table,
 .clientlist_viewlist.RT .card.client_list .table,.clientlist_viewlist .card.client_list table,
-- 
